    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW21jZfxe5AmskoMP3AYBnVbr)_\n\nBefore: `.config/emacs-modular/initback` (about 25 KB) sat in the tree, a backup of an older configuration.\n\nAfter: the file is deleted. I searched the `.el`, `.org`, `.md` and ignore files for `initback` and nothing refers to it, so nothing else changes. `CHANGELOG.org` has a Removed entry. The file stays in git history if it is ever wanted again.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01T2BcMQ3qdNUiW5oZRLQRsG)_",
